@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Eve runtime guide
+
+Run this project with Node.js 24 or newer, as required by `package.json`.
+
+The supported static forms are the default nested `agent/agent.ts` definition, exact lowercase `agent/instructions.md`, the bound TypeScript output schema, one default `defineTool` module such as `agent/tools/status.ts`, and one default `defineSkill` module such as `agent/skills/triage.ts`. Prefer these forms when replacing a runtime-dependent equivalent.
+
+Do not infer remote-agent registration, extension contributions, connection or framework tools, filesystem-collision precedence, reserved-name handling, or advanced runtime behavior from filesystem shape alone. Establish each through focused runtime evidence or a supported static form; provider and model behavior remain outside this repository's evidence.
